Z||000005||Ozzy||05-29-2000||01:14 AM||||I can dig it! <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"> <P>MM...I agree that it could get nasty with real time flaming but if you look at the forum as an example, the flaming does not last long at all and usually the primary offender ends up getting pi$$ed off and leaving, or at the least never posting again. (I'm quite sure the most recent offender still looks at the forum. If one does not have the discipline to refrain from such "debates", one certainly cannot help but keep checking to see what everyone is saying about them! <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"> )<P>Also, unless it's a complete idiot like our recent little Fiero razzin' buddy, with nothing better to do but stir up trouble, most won't engage in a 'face to face' type conflict more than once. I think every one of the resident members here does a great job of containing themselves. We all engage in a little warfare but only to defend our lil' piece o' home turf I think...(if I might be so bold as to consider myself a resident member! <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"> )<P>Ozzy||||reg||1
