Z||000015||Ozzy||05-30-2000||05:14 PM||||I like the idea of a specific set of topics on a formal chat meeting. Otherwise everyone will be clambering over each others conversations... <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/confused.gif"> JUst a thought.<P>8:00pm est would be too early for this west coast guy...I don't usually find time to log in before 6:00pm PST.<P>MM...Not sure what you mean but when I log in to the chat room, I shrink the window and leave only the portion of the chat room screen visible that shows me when someone else has entered...then I open the forum up in another window (not full screen) and look thru the posts. The chat room remains active, but will time out if no activity after about (guess)10 mins. All I do to keep it active is type in a word and enter it on the chat screen. <P>Ozzy||||reg||1
