Z||000017||tgowens||05-31-2000||06:11 PM||||I'm on the same coast as Ozzy, Cutter that would be 4-5:00 PM out here and most of us aren't home at that time much less through with dinner -- I know it's hard with a three hour time difference between coasts but maybe we could log on a little early (say around 6:30 (time to get home and eat) and catch you all before you head to bed?)<P>I have been in other chats and it seems that some come in just as others are signing off -- there may be a period where most of the people logged on are from the east coast and as time goes on more of the west coast people show up -- my guess is that most of the people would be signed on around 9:30 to 10:30 Eastern time - 6:30 to 7:30 Pacific time).......<P>just my 2cents..........||||reg||1
